{% comment %}
  OB: PDP trust strip — short delivery/service promises under the buy row.

  Statements come from repeatable `usp` blocks on main-product rather than from
  hard-coded copy, because these are merchandising claims that change and must
  be legally accurate per market. The reference's own second line ("30 dagen
  gratis retour") is deliberately NOT the default: the published policy
  withholds €5.95 in return costs, so shipping it would be a false claim.

  Renders nothing at all — including its rules — when no block has text, so an
  unconfigured PDP shows no empty band.

  Accepts:
  - blocks: {Array} section.blocks

  Usage:
  {% render 'ob-usp-strip', blocks: section.blocks %}
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign ob_usp_count = 0
  for block in blocks
    if block.type == 'usp' and block.settings.text != blank
      assign ob_usp_count = ob_usp_count | plus: 1
    endif
  endfor
-%}

{%- if ob_usp_count > 0 -%}
  <div class="ob-usp">
    {%- for block in blocks -%}
      {%- if block.type == 'usp' and block.settings.text != blank -%}
        <div class="ob-usp__item" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
          {%- render 'ob-icon', icon: block.settings.icon, class: 'ob-usp__icon' -%}
          <span>{{ block.settings.text }}</span>
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
